MDWeb is a self-hosted Markdown blogging platform with a React frontend
and Express (TypeScript) API. Posts and themes are stored as plain files;
optional AI helpers can summarize or enhance content via Ollama or OpenAI.

Features include admin/contributor roles, theming, image management with
WebP conversion, feature toggles, and FreeBSD rc(8) service integration.

WWW: https://github.com/marklapointe/freebsdguy
